OL,3,GNEWSAI've learned lessons after summer
OL,4,Abudget defeat, Wales' first minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first minister says his government
OL,8,Fhas learned "lessons" after his
OL,9,Fmid-year spending plans were defeated
OL,10,Fin the Senedd.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, Rhun ap Iorwerth said
OL,13,Fdiscussions were starting to avoid a
OL,14,Frepeat when the Welsh government budget
OL,15,Fis discussed next year.
OL,17,FPlaid Cymru's leader promised to
OL,18,F"improve the way we engage with others"
OL,19,Fafter the supplementary budget vote in
OL,20,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
