OL,3,GNEWSAI've learned lessons after summer
OL,4,Abudget defeat, Wales' first minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe comments were broadly welcomed by
OL,8,FLabour, the Tories and Reform, who had
OL,9,Fall refused to support the #300m
OL,10,Fsupplementary budget in the summer.
